== Research Interests
My research interest mainly lies in the Cybersecurity of Cyber-Physical Systems (such as Smart Grid, Internet of Vehicles) and Security of Artificial Intelligence (include but not limited to Cross/Multi-modal Learning).
~~~


== News

- Jul. 2026, Our paper [https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.15047 ``*BT-MTD: Bus Traversal-based Moving Target Defense for Smart Grid*''] is accepted by *IEEE Systems Journal* (IF: 4.9). The code of BT-MTD is available at [https://github.com/YJY101/BT-MTD here]. 

- Jul. 2026, I am honored to receive the *Shanghai Teaching Reform Promotion General Project (Higher Education) / Second Prize of Shanghai Teaching Achievement Award*.  (上海市教学改革推进（高等教育类）一般项目 \/ 上海市教学成果二等奖，6\/10). [https://edu.sh.gov.cn/xxgk2_zdgz_jsgz_02/20260720/1eee22fff5ef4fb28f37cdea97ad6a5b.html
 Link] 



- Dec. 2025, I am prompted to *Associate Professor* within two years. 

- Oct. 2025, Our paper [https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.21227 ``*The Role of Information Incompleteness in Defending Against Stealth Attacks*''] is available on arXiv now. 

- Apr. 2025, I am honored to receive the *First Prize of Shanghai Technology Invention Award* (上海市技术发明奖一等奖, 11/15). 

- Dec. 2024, I am prompted to the *Senior Member* grade of *IEEE*. 

- Nov. 2024, the manuscript [https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.16024 ``*Stealth Attacks Against Moving Target Defense for Smart Grid*''] is available on arXiv now. 


